      "side": 1,
      "message": "I realize this is pre-existing, so it\u0027s probably a question for Rob: Why are we aliasing ETC1 and ETC2? I guess if we only support devices that have ETC2, then it\u0027s okay? Otherwise, it feels strange -- ETC1 is a strict subset of ETC2, if my memory is correct.",
      "revId": "0501db6b4a64ab2af60ccea8b83ebcef72d7c415",
