      "writtenOn": "2023-03-14T17:30:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe the reasoning was that we support ETC2 but that is backwards compatible w/ ETC1 so, if the client wants to talk in terms of ETC1, we\u0027ll let them.\n\nWe could be stricter and force clients to only talk in ETC2 terms.",
